---
description: Performance and bundle budgets
globs: src/**/*,scripts/audit/bundle-audit.mjs,lighthouserc.cjs
alwaysApply: false
---

- Initial JS referenced from HTML: <= 50 KB gzip (`npm run audit:bundles`).
- System font stack only (`src/styles/global.css`).
- Reserve ad slot height (`--ad-slot-h`) to limit CLS.
- Run `npm run lighthouse` before merging large UI changes.
- LCP target < 2.0s mobile lab; tool pages may warn in LHCI when long SEO HTML is present.
